          <h3 itemprop="name">Is the Kindle Colorsoft Signature Edition discontinued?</h3>
          <div itemscope itemprop="acceptedAnswer" itemtype="https://schema.org/Answer">
            <div itemprop="text">
              <p>Amazon has not issued a formal discontinuation notice, but as of September 9, 2026 the Kindle Colorsoft Signature Edition is listed as "currently unavailable" on Amazon's US storefront and across multiple international Amazon properties, including the UK. The cheaper Kindle Colorsoft 16GB remains on sale, and the Signature Edition still appears available in some markets such as Canada. The pattern of pulling the premium SKU while keeping the cheaper one strongly suggests the model is being retired.</p>
            </div>
