        </div>

        <div itemscope itemprop="mainEntity" itemtype="https://schema.org/Question">
          <h3 itemprop="name">Can I still buy a Kindle Colorsoft Signature Edition?</h3>
          <div itemscope itemprop="acceptedAnswer" itemtype="https://schema.org/Answer">
            <div itemprop="text">
              <p>Not at normal retail in the United States or United Kingdom. Your options are limited to remaining stock in regions where it is still listed, refurbished or used units from third-party resellers, or buying the Kindle Colorsoft 16GB instead, which costs $249 and uses the fixed screen stack that eliminated the yellow banding issue. If you buy used, verify which hardware revision you are getting.</p>
            </div>
          </div>
