            <div itemprop="text">
              <p>No. Your device keeps working, keeps syncing, and remains on Amazon's firmware support path — there is no announced end-of-life for firmware. What changes is that you can no longer buy the hardware new, and replacement parts or warranty service may become harder over time. It is worth keeping local EPUB copies of anything in your library so a future device switch does not lock you out of your own books.</p>
            </div>
