            <div itemprop="text">
              <p>That is the most plausible explanation for the timing. Amazon is expected to refresh its Kindle lineup ahead of the EU Battery Law taking effect in February 2027, which requires user-replaceable batteries and forces a hardware redesign. Removing the premium color SKU now simplifies the lineup ahead of that refresh. A second-generation color Kindle has been widely anticipated, but Amazon has not confirmed a date, a price, or specifications.</p>
